title: Party Finances
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and dues_timer <= 0
on-arrival: dues_timer = 4; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs

= Party Finances

The district treasurers want to know what the Zentrale expects of them. [? if inflation >= 60 : Dues collected on Friday are worth half as much by the time they reach Berlin. ?][? if inflation < 60 and year >= 1921 : Most members are poor, and many are out of work. ?][? if inflation < 60 and year <= 1920 : Paper, presses, rent and train tickets all have to be paid for. ?]

- @maintain: Collect the usual dues.
- @raise: Raise the dues.
- @lower: Cut the dues for the unemployed.
- @stable: Fix the dues in gold marks.
- @easy_discard

@maintain
subtitle: [? if inflation < 80 : [+ dues +] funds. ?][? if inflation >= 80 : One fund: the rest is eaten by inflation. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources += (Q.inflation >= 80) ? 1 : Q.dues;
!}

@raise
subtitle: [+ dues + 1 +] funds now, and more every time after. Some members will not pay it.
view-if: inflation < 80
choose-if: dues < 4
unavailable-subtitle: The members cannot pay any more than they do.
on-arrival: {!
Q.dues += 1;
Q.resources += Q.dues;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 0.97;
}
!}

The money comes in, with complaints.

@lower
subtitle: Nothing this time, and less from now on. More of the unemployed join and stay.
choose-if: dues >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Dues are already as low as they can go.
on-arrival: {!
Q.dues -= 1;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 1.05;
}
!}

@stable
subtitle: [+ dues +] funds, whatever the mark does. The poorest members drop out.
view-if: inflation >= 60
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources += Q.dues;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 0.95;
}
!}

Dues are collected on payday, before the money loses its value. The treasurers keep their accounts in dollars and rye.
